STARTFONT 2.1
COMMENT Glyph source for scripts/render_demo.py, which draws docs/demo.png.
COMMENT U+0020 to U+007E are the glyphs of koi9x15, the 9x15 Misc Fixed font in
COMMENT X.Org font-misc-cyrillic, read from koi9x15.pcf.gz in Debian xfonts-cyrillic
COMMENT 1:1.0.5+nmu1. Their KOI8-R codes equal their ISO 10646 code points.
COMMENT That font's COPYRIGHT property reads "Public domain font.  Share and enjoy."
COMMENT U+00A7 SECTION SIGN was drawn for this repository, because koi9x15 has none.
FONT -Misc-Fixed-Medium-R-Normal--15-140-75-75-C-90-ISO10646-1
SIZE 14 75 75
FONTBOUNDINGBOX 9 15 0 -3
STARTPROPERTIES 17
FOUNDRY "Misc"
FAMILY_NAME "Fixed"
WEIGHT_NAME "Medium"
SLANT "R"
SETWIDTH_NAME "Normal"
ADD_STYLE_NAME ""
PIXEL_SIZE 15
POINT_SIZE 140
RESOLUTION_X 75
RESOLUTION_Y 75
SPACING "C"
AVERAGE_WIDTH 90
CHARSET_REGISTRY "ISO10646"
CHARSET_ENCODING "1"
FONT_ASCENT 12
FONT_DESCENT 3
COPYRIGHT "Public domain font.  Share and enjoy."
ENDPROPERTIES
